    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God’s Faithfulness to His People"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Give thanks to the Lord, call on his name;",
          "proclaim his deeds among the peoples."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing to him, sing praise to him;",
          "tell about all his wondrous works!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Boast in his holy name;",
          "let the hearts of those who seek the Lord rejoice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Seek the Lord and his strength;",
          "seek his face always."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Remember the wondrous works he has done,",
          "his wonders, and the judgments he has pronounced, ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "you offspring of Abraham his servant,",
          "Jacob’s descendants #— #his chosen ones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He is the Lord our God;",
          "his judgments govern the whole earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He remembers his covenant forever,",
          "the promise he ordained",
          "for a thousand generations —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the covenant he made with Abraham,",
          "swore to Isaac,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and confirmed to Jacob as a decree",
          "and to Israel as a permanent covenant:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I will give the land of Canaan to you",
          "as your inherited portion.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When they were few in number,",
          "very few indeed,",
          "and resident aliens in Canaan,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "wandering from nation to nation",
          "and from one kingdom to another,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "he allowed no one to oppress them;",
          "he rebuked kings on their behalf:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Do not touch my anointed ones,",
          "or harm my prophets.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He called down famine against the land",
          "and destroyed the entire food supply."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He had sent a man ahead of them —",
          "Joseph, who was sold as a slave."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They hurt his feet with shackles;",
          "his neck was put in an iron collar."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Until the time his prediction came true,",
          "the word of the Lord tested him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The king sent for him and released him;",
          "the ruler of peoples set him free."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He made him master of his household,",
          "ruler over all his possessions —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "binding his officials at will",
          "and instructing his elders."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then Israel went to Egypt;",
          "Jacob lived as an alien in the land of Ham. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord made his people very fruitful;",
          "he made them more numerous than their foes,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "whose hearts he turned to hate his people",
          "and to deal deceptively with his servants."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent Moses his servant,",
          "and Aaron, whom he had chosen."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They performed his miraculous signs among them",
          "and wonders in the land of Ham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent darkness, and it became dark —",
          "for did they not defy his commands?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turned their water into blood",
          "and caused their fish to die."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Their land was overrun with frogs,",
          "even in their royal chambers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spoke, and insects came —",
          "gnats throughout their country."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gave them hail for rain,",
          "and lightning throughout their land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He struck their vines and fig trees",
          "and shattered the trees of their territory."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spoke, and locusts came —",
          "young locusts without number."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They devoured all the vegetation in their land",
          "and consumed the produce of their land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He struck all the firstborn in their land,",
          "all their first progeny."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then he brought Israel out with silver and gold,",
          "and no one among his tribes stumbled."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Egypt was glad when they left,",
          "for the dread of Israel had fallen on them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spread a cloud as a covering",
          "and gave a fire to light up the night."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They asked, and he brought quail",
          "and satisfied them with bread from heaven."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He opened a rock, and water gushed out;",
          "it flowed like a stream in the desert."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he remembered his holy promise",
          "to Abraham his servant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He brought his people out with rejoicing,",
          "his chosen ones with shouts of joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          44
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He gave them the lands of the nations,",
          "and they inherited",
          "what other peoples had worked for."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          45
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All this happened",
          "so that they might keep his statutes",
          "and obey his instructions.",
          "Hallelujah!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
